<title>JAPAN: MOF'S MITSUZUKA SAYS YAMAICHI RESHUFFLE BOLD STEP.</title>
<headline>MOF'S MITSUZUKA SAYS YAMAICHI RESHUFFLE BOLD STEP.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said on Monday that he sees changes in Yamaichi Securities Co Ltd's top management as a bold step and that he has high expectations about the brokerage's future performance.  </p>
<p>Mitsuzuka told reporters the announcement of the management reshuffle must reflect the company's determination to restructure its business.</p>
<p>&quot;I think it was a bold step.... I heard that was the best new management structure that the company could come up with. Therefore, I have high expectations (of its future performance),&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
